WEBVTT

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:18.740
We would like to hire you to snipe for us exclusively.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.370
This is the expressed wish of my employer.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:26.750
Your remuneration will be $10 million per month.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.500
I hope that's to your liking?

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.010
How did you find out I was here?

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:40.850
Well...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:45.520
Let's just say my employer has his own intelligence network.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:50.570
If the amount of money is to your disfavor...

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.900
Is that your only business?

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.410
I've never once considered working for a sole client.

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:04.790
I see.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:12.050
I will repeat that to my employer once I return.

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.050
However...

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:23.060
Please withdraw $50,000 in cash.

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.440
It will be a moment, sir.

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:33.820
<i>Whatever your answer may be, my
employer is not one to ever give up.</i>

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:40.530
<i>Ever since he was born, there has never been
anything he wanted that he wasn't able to obtain.</i>

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:43.950
I'm sorry, but there seems to be a mistake.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.580
This card was deactivated just yesterday.

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:50.880
What do you mean?

00:01:55.340 --> 00:01:58.970
Right now, your balance is at zero.

00:01:58.970 --> 00:02:04.970
Your card was deactivated twenty-four hours ago, so I'm afraid you can't use it.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.430
I want to see the manager.

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:09.350
I'm afraid he's unavailable right now.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.770
Take all the time you need.

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.900
Call us once you're finished.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:14.170
Mr. Duke Togo. There is a phone call for you.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:24.140
Do you remember me? This is Nicholas Miller.

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:28.520
We made sure not to touch what was in that safety deposit box.

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:35.610
I'm sure without that cash in hand, you would be
presently impeded in carrying out the jobs you took.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:41.360
My employer thinks very highly of you.

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:48.290
He proposes that you not be his employee, but rather his full and equal partner.

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.500
So what do you think?

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.790
This is a definite win-win for both parties.

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.840
Has your conversation ended?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.880
Do you know who my caller was?

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.840
No, unfortunately.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:08.260
They didn't even let me know the purpose of the call.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:16.900
I walk unsteadily on paths to nowhere

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:21.030
wondering what I should do right now.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:27.490
I play the song you like on the car stereo

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:32.040
with the volume up and my feelings crystallized

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:37.670
driving on streets with no crossroads or signals

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:43.090
with a speed that will catch up with you.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:47.550
So faraway - let's run!

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:53.850
And let's not bother with the breaks - full throttle.

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:58.150
Oh someday - one of these days

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:03.240
You'll be at my place where nobody can find you.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:09.330
Whenever you suffer a breakdown one can't see

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:14.910
depend on me for your repairs.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:19.290
So faraway - let's run!

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:25.510
We'll reset and start again - even at our limit.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.800
Oh someday - one of these days

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:35.850
If I'm with you we'll find our dream.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:46.070
Rockford's Ambitions

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.870
Hmm.

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:58.120
So he won't bend to my will no matter what?

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.630
I am truly sorry.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.250
Let's go, Miller.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:09.140
Now that I have him cornered, there's no question that he'll be coming after me.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:15.640
I simply cannot die. I still have to pursue my family's ambitions.

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:17.640
Yes.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:21.940
To conquer this world with our expansive wealth.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.900
Of course. I agree with you completely, sir.

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:30.110
So... how do we get him in my grasp?

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:47.090
<i>Kill that mafia boss, Shalim Klein!</i>

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:50.010
<i>Drawing and quartering is too good for that rat bastard!</i>

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.620
His security detail is exceedingly tight.

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:19.580
However, Klein never misses his Sunday worship.

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:25.590
He will definitely arrive at the church.

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.970
At that moment... maybe, just maybe...

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:54.530
What?

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.030
Where did it come from?

00:07:57.030 --> 00:07:58.240
Wh-Where? Huh?!

00:07:58.240 --> 00:07:59.040
Mr. Klein!

00:07:58.660 --> 00:07:59.040
Hey!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.860
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:38.740
Here's your $3 million compensation.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.750
I was going to transfer it to your Swiss bank account

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:46.460
but you all of a sudden told me to pay you in cash instead, which flustered me a bit.

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:54.470
Actually, I had a fair share of difficulty getting this kind of cash together.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:09:02.220
That is to say right after I took your call, I found out that they froze my assets.

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:07.610
They've also similarly froze my secret accounts.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.400
Ah.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:13.530
It appears that you made yourself a powerful enemy.

00:09:15.110 --> 00:09:17.280
David Rockford.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:22.160
He's the present head of the Rockford family, the most powerful tycoons in the world.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:25.290
He's the only one who could have pulled that trick on me!

00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:27.790
David Rockford.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:33.590
The Rockford family fortunes, publicly at least, is about $6.5 trillion.

00:09:34.760 --> 00:09:38.390
But their actual fortunes must be
hundreds of times more than that.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:45.600
He governs more than a thousand international corporations under his vast umbrella.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:53.530
Meaning he alone owns nearly all the large and powerful corporations in the world.

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:56.780
With that in mind, there is no dispute.

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:06.870
On top of that, he buys every country's election, even going as far as funding revolutions.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:11.960
He's not only subjugated the economic world, he also controls the political world as well!

00:10:12.590 --> 00:10:14.960
Do you understand, Mr. Duke Togo?

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.970
Having Rockford as your enemy...

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:21.600
...means you have the whole world against you!

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.240
Do you know where Rockford is?

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.120
No.

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:52.000
Even among his closest associates, only a handful knows that fact.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:10:59.260
Wait a minute...

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:01.840
With him, there might be...

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:02.970
Who?

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:04.970
Expat Chinese moguls.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:11.650
They might not match Rockford's economic clout, but their intelligence network is something to behold.

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:20.650
If anything, they are few in number but unwilling to bend to Rockford's will, just like you.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:28.040
And luckily for us, Rockford is currently trying to put the squeeze on those guys.

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:33.130
Ou Kyouson the Elder is the one leading that resistance.

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.420
However...

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.420
...it may be only a matter of time
before he also controls those expats.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.680
<i>Ou Kyouson.</i>

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:17.800
Master Duke Togo.

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.720
My lord, Ou Kyouson, has sent me to get you.

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:27.300
I am Tou Tesshou.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:30.930
If you may.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.240
How did you know I was coming?

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:52.500
The list of everyone who arrives at Taipei's airport is sent to Ou no later than 10 minutes.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:59.420
Actually, Ou has been looking for you these past two weeks.

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:00.670
Me?

00:13:00.670 --> 00:13:01.510
Yes.

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:07.970
However, despite the increased efforts of his intel network, we were still strangely unable to get in contact with you.

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.100
<i>Was Rockford behind that?</i>

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:15.480
We were just about to give up when we spotted you.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:19.020
Ou is greatly pleased by this news.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.990
Still, we are very lucky that you came.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:54.520
I've brought Master Duke Togo here.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:02.820
So you've finally arrived!

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:11.870
Oh... you don't entrust your dominant arm to someone you never met, even me I suppose?

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.620
Still, I'm very glad you came.

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.210
As you can see, I don't have very long to live.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:26.630
I really needed to meet with you before I go.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:34.970
My family's overseas mercantile dynasty is now facing its biggest crisis in its 3000-year history.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:36.600
Rockford?

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.980
Yes, exactly what you said.

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:47.320
We're still able to handle someone who's only out to gain a profit at our expense.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:53.870
But that Rockford is different. He's set to crush us entirely underfoot...

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.660
E-Excuse me.

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:10.380
It's frustrating.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:17.020
It's plainly clear that we cannot repel Rockford by our strength alone. Which brings us to...

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:34.120
We want you to lend us your strength to finish David Rockford once and for all.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:08.940
What?

00:16:09.650 --> 00:16:14.660
He, Golgo 13, is now making his moves to shoot me dead?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:15.620
Yes.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:19.290
And his client is unmistakably Ou Kyouson.

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:20.370
Damn it!

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:23.250
So I've lost the initiative to that senile fossil?

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:27.130
I should have snuffed out his life sooner when I had the chance!

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:29.340
What will you do?

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:33.840
Even with Golgo 13 on the move, perhaps it's not to late to...

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:36.180
Don't spew nonsense!

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:38.720
Don't act as if there's <i>any</i>  sort of way to stop him!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.530
Wait... there is!

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:56.240
There might be one possible way we could stop him... Golgo 13.

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.490
With that man's help...

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.580
With that man's help... maybe.

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:30.020
Mr. Duke Togo, I presume?

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.690
Please wait a moment.

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:38.030
You may be familiar with who I am, Mr. Togo.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:43.540
I received a personal call from a friend this morning.

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:48.080
I don't believe I need to tell you who that friend was.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.880
Mr. Togo, you must stand down this instant.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.800
If you are not out of Switzerland in three hours...

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:00.550
You will have the entire world's police agencies hot on your tail.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:05.350
Of course, we do want to avoid
having that situation on our hands.

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.900
I'm sure you understand, Mr. Togo.

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:24.750
Hopefully Golgo 13 received that call.

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:30.580
I think that call might very well solve our present problem...

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:34.590
...but what if he in fact didn't take that call?

00:18:35.550 --> 00:18:36.840
All we can do is wait.

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:43.100
Well, this car is similar to a tank.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:46.480
You'll be all right as long as you're in here.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:48.140
Our only problem is your mountain villa-

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.270
That's enough!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.810
I already said all we can do is wait!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:55.360
How the hell will this thing stand against a Golgo 13?

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:17.010
Well, I did think to take extra precautions.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.250
Nothing seems to be out of place at the moment.

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:06.810
Hello?

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.270
Oh, so he took your call?

00:20:10.270 --> 00:20:11.890
Mm-hmm... mm-hmm!

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.690
I see, then that's perfect.

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:17.820
I'll see to it that you're re-elected.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.540
Th-Thank heavens!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.290
Oh, allow me...

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:36.290
Relax.

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:40.260
I'm sure that guy was thoroughly shocked.

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:44.340
Getting a warning from our very own Commander in Chief.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.220
I concur!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:50.520
If that were me, I wouldn't believe my ears!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.520
Quit acting so humble.

00:20:52.520 --> 00:20:56.350
You're in front of the man who's about to take over the world, are you not?

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:58.570
Yes, that's right!

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:02.690
Working close at your side made me forget that enormity.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.870
Good work, Miller. You deserve this drink.

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.450
Thank you very much!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:18.380
Now then.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:26.300
I must think of an absolute weak point I can exploit that will put him, Golgo 13, within my very grasp.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:32.100
Beautiful.

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:37.350
Is there any way to describe how beautiful the forest and the lake looks from here?

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:38.730
I fully agree.

00:21:38.730 --> 00:21:43.110
And the whole scene being lit by moonlight makes it all the more beautiful.

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:47.130
I  was worried with no one to talk to.

00:22:47.130 --> 00:22:50.180
I was brooding and standing still

00:22:50.180 --> 00:22:52.350
without moving a muscle.

00:22:53.010 --> 00:22:55.520
I wonder when that was?

00:22:56.020 --> 00:22:57.230
I'm sure

00:22:57.230 --> 00:23:00.400
you agonized over how

00:23:00.400 --> 00:23:05.650
people will hurt themselves and other people

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.900
and fail to realize it.

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:10.030
When

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:13.450
the same days keep repeating themselves

00:23:13.450 --> 00:23:15.700
you never change.

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:17.950
Since you're here for me

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:22.250
I will accept the way that I am.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:26.500
I will never leave you alone

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:29.840
I will softly touch your trembling heart.

00:23:30.050 --> 00:23:36.720
I realized that I'm not the only one who's alone.

00:23:36.720 --> 00:23:39.890
We're enveloped in the gentle sun beams.

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:43.230
The long winter is finally over.

00:23:43.230 --> 00:23:49.860
The parts of us that were lonely will surely get stronger.

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:06.500
His target is a prisoner who's locked away in a maximum security prison.

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:09.970
Golgo positions his rifle from a tent he set up the woods.

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:14.220
His chance to shoot will come only once in a ten-hour span.

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:19.310
So he pushes his limit by staying still and looking through the scope.

00:24:19.640 --> 00:24:25.150
One out of 36,000 Seconds

00:24:19.720 --> 00:24:24.520
Next time on Golgo 13: One Out Of 36,000 Seconds.

00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:28.320
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
